  "title": "SpaceX's Market Challenges and Industry Shifts",
  "summary": "SpaceX faces ongoing challenges in its Starship program, with booster failures reported, while the company continues to expand into new markets and revenue streams. Meanwhile, the tech giant is expanding its AI and hardware innovation efforts.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "SpaceX reported a 92% revenue increase since its IPO, beating Wall Street expectations, with a $541m loss despite $7.81bn in revenue.",
